      524.64,
      303.51,
      582.71
    ],
    "text": "Below mentioned land depicted as Lot No. 1 in Plan No.RP/MR/2752 situated in the village of Malimbada, inMalimbada Divisional Secretariat Division, in Matara District,in Southern Province was acquired for the construction ofMaimbada Police Station.",
